--------------------------------
PythonDispatcherTLS (Python调度器线程局部状态)
来源: c10/core/impl/PythonDispatcherTLS.cpp, c10/core/impl/PythonDispatcherTLS.h
--------------------------------

【状态】
    pythonDispatcherState: thread_local PyInterpreter*    # 线程局部的Python解释器指针

【接口】
    set_state(state: PyInterpreter*)用途: 设置当前线程的Python解释器状态
        逻辑:
            if state != nullptr:
                tls_set_dispatch_key_included(DispatchKey::PythonDispatcher, true)
            else:
                reset_state()
            pythonDispatcherState = state

    get_state() -> PyInterpreter*
        用途: 获取当前线程的Python解释器状态

    reset_state()
        用途: 清空当前线程的Python解释器状态
        逻辑:
            pythonDispatcherState = nullptr
            tls_set_dispatch_key_included(DispatchKey::PythonDispatcher, false)

【依赖】
    c10::impl::tls_set_dispatch_key_included    # 设置调度键的TLS包含状态

--------------------------------
DisablePythonDispatcher (RAII禁用Python调度器)
来源: c10/core/impl/PythonDispatcherTLS.h
--------------------------------

【状态】
    old_: PyInterpreter*    # 保存的旧状态

【接口】
    DisablePythonDispatcher()
        用途: 构造时保存当前状态并禁用Python调度器
        逻辑:
            old_ = PythonDispatcherTLS::get_state()
            PythonDispatcherTLS::set_state(nullptr)

    ~DisablePythonDispatcher()
        用途: 析构时恢复之前的状态
        逻辑:
            PythonDispatcherTLS::set_state(old_)

【备注】
    - 不可复制、不可移动的RAII类
    - 用于临时禁用Python调度器，作用域结束后自动恢复
